  "title": "DADDY IS A PHONE | He Worked Abroad for 5 Years | Animated Short Film",
  "description": "He left so his daughter could have everything. Five years later, she asked her mom: \"Who is he?\"\n\nA silent animated short film about the millions of fathers and mothers who work far from home — and the price nobody puts on the payslip.\n\nIf someone you love is far away right now, call them today. Not tomorrow.\n\nRyzon is a silent animated universe about the problems people don't say out loud: family, loneliness, addiction and regret.\n\nTell us in the comments: who are you working for?\n\n#animatedshortfilm #workingabroad #fatheranddaughter",
